<title>UK: World Bank sets A$100 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets A$100 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    27.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.64    PAY DATE    27.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.375</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	     SENIOR.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
